# The activity shortcut (decision 050, Ctrl+Alt+Q by default): from anywhere,
# the card of the pill's activity, the one a click on the pill opens.

scenario: with no activity it does nothing
open-activity                       -> Idle
panel focus
open-activity                       -> Idle

scenario: it opens the pill's activity's card, and closes it when pressed again
start media                         -> Compact
open-activity                       -> Expanded expanded=media
open-activity                       -> Compact

scenario: in Split it opens the pill's activity, not the bubble's
start media
start timer timeSensitive           -> Split top=timer bubble=media
open-activity                       -> Expanded expanded=timer
promote media                       # the pick changes the pill: the shortcut follows it
open-activity                       -> Expanded expanded=media
open-activity                       -> Split top=media

scenario: from Home or another card it goes to the activity's card
panel focus
start media
home                                -> Expanded expanded=home
open-activity                       -> Expanded expanded=media
esc                                 -> Compact
start timer timeSensitive
bubble                              -> Expanded expanded=media
open-activity                       -> Expanded expanded=timer

scenario: over an alert it opens the activity's card, and times out like a click's
start media
alert ding                          -> Alert alert=ding
open-activity                       -> Expanded expanded=media
wait 7999                           -> Expanded
wait 1
